# &quot;The Rush of Images&quot;: A Research Report into Digital Editing and the Moving Image.

**Authors:** Burn, Andrew, Brindley, Sue, Durran, James, Kelsall, Carol, Sweetlove, Jane, Tuohey, Caroline

## Abstract
Describes an action research project on digital editing being carried out by a group of teachers. Evaluates a conceptual framework for editing digitized moving images, under three headings: literacies and communicative practices; creativity; and social roles and learning styles. Presents three teacher accounts of student projects involving digital editing and the skills it demands of, and develops in, students. (SR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ632306

